	(text "NOTES\n1. Variant J of the Rev B control PCB (layout-revB.md). Placement: KiCad top view = front view, Y_front = -Y_kicad.\n2. BOM: 8 x 10k (R1-R8, axial 0207), 8 x 10 nF (C1-C8, KEMET C317, 5.08 mm leads -> P5.00 footprint).\n3. Project-local symbols/footprints: control.kicad_sym / control.pretty. JS1 THB001P footprint is PROVISIONAL footprint: see README (TBV).\n4. ENC1 PEC11R: A-C-B order per Bourns; print the footprints 1:1 and test-fit before ordering."
